   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Syntactic inversion with adverbial connectors",
     "texto": [
      "Both **einerseits** and **andererseits** function as connecting adverbs that occupy the first syntactic position of their respective clauses. Therefore, they cause the **obligatory inversion of the subject**, placing the conjugated verb immediately in second position: **Einerseits bietet der Standort steuerliche Vorteile, andererseits sind die Lohnkosten extrem hoch.**",
      "If they are coordinated within the same clause, the subject can remain common if there is no ambiguity: **Der Beschluss ist einerseits mutig, andererseits riskant.**"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Contrasting structure",
